## @file
#  A733 Clock / Reset Controller abstraction library
#
#  Converges the scattered per-driver CCU register pokes (gates, resets,
#  PLLs, muxes, dividers, and the keyed MBUS/AHB gate registers) into one
#  SoC library so register bit definitions live in exactly one place.
#
